+// Age is an eviction preference, not proof of GPU completion. Each queue is ordered, so its
+// latest use fence also protects all earlier uses on that queue. Protected and ordinary queues
+// must be tracked separately. Fence is generic so this policy can be tested without a GPU.
+template<typename Fence>
+class VulkanPipelineLifetime {
+public:
